m ταὐτός (tautós, “the same”), with -ло́гія (-lóhija) ending from Ancient Greek -λογία (-logía). Compare Russian тавтоло́гия (tavtológija), Belarusian таўтало́гія (tawtalóhija), Polish ta"},{"parola":"цинізм","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"cynicism","termine_origine":"cynismus","catena":[{"codice":"la-lat","nome":"Late Latin","termine":"cynismus","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"grc","nome":"Ancient Greek","termine":"κῠνῐσμός","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"grc","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Late Latin cynismus, from Ancient Greek κῠνῐσμός (kŭnĭsmós). With -ізм (-izm) suffix. Compare Russian цини́зм (cinízm), Belarusian цыні́зм (cynízm), Polish cynizm."}]}